sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant Proxy as Vercel API Proxy
    participant Auth as FastAPI Auth
    participant Google as Google OAuth
    participant DB as Postgres DB

    User->>FE: Click Sign In
    FE->>Proxy: Google credential JWT
    Proxy->>Auth: POST /auth/login
    Auth->>Google: Verify token
    Google-->>Auth: User profile
    Auth->>DB: Upsert user
    DB-->>Auth: User record
    Auth-->>Proxy: JWT + user
    Proxy-->>FE: Store in session
    FE-->>User: Protected routes
